                "imageInfos" : "",
                "richTextValue" : "<h1>Cultivated American Ginseng</h1>\n\n<p>Cultivated American ginseng (Panax quinquefolius L.), grown near the 45°north latitude, \n    takes 3-5 years to mature. It has been traditionally used to balance internal heat, \n    reduce stress, promote relaxation, and improve sleep. A well-rested and less-stressed body, \n    in turn, boosts energy levels and enhances cognitive function over time.</p>"
              },
              "definition" : "community_builder:htmlEditor",
              "id" : "dd30b5b4-ce39-4407-8967-3dcba47d010d",
              "type" : "component"
            } ],
