              "attributes" : {
                "dxpStyle" : { },
                "imageInfos" : "",
                "richTextValue" : "<h1>Red American Ginseng</h1>\n\n<p>American red ginseng (Panax quinquefolius L.) is steamed and then \n    dried, which changes the color of the root and its nature, giving \n    it a darker appearance and making it more energizing and warming \n    compared to traditional white American ginseng. \n    The steaming process also intensifies its strong, earthy, and sweet flavor.</p>"
              },
              "definition" : "community_builder:htmlEditor",
              "id" : "1981d7cf-dfe6-48d2-831b-6881f55ba667",
              "type" : "component"
            } ],
