          "children" : [ {
            "children" : [ {
              "attributes" : {
                "dxpStyle" : { },
                "imageInfos" : "",
                "richTextValue" : "<h1>Wild American Ginseng</h1>\n\n<p>Wild American ginseng (Panax quinquefolius L.) naturally \n    grows in shaded forests across the United States and Canada, taking over 10 years to reach maturity. Competing with surrounding plants and facing challenges from varying climate conditions, it is prized for its complex flavor and higher concentration of beneficial compounds like ginsenosides. \n    Traditionally, it has been used in herbal medicine to reduce stress, \n    enhance immune function, and boost energy levels.</p>"
              },
              "definition" : "community_builder:htmlEditor",
              "id" : "2d7d12ab-493b-49c0-a231-8194d09c988a",
              "type" : "component"
            } ],
