          "children" : [ {
            "children" : [ {
              "attributes" : {
                "dxpStyle" : { },
                "imageInfos" : "",
                "richTextValue" : "<h1>Korean American Ginseng</h1>\n\n<p>Korean ginseng (Panax CA Meyer), also known as Asian ginseng or Panax ginseng and \n    similarly found in white and red types, is a plant native to the mountainous \n    regions of Korea and China. For this reason, it is similar to caffeine, making it a \n    popular ingredient in energy drinks in the United States due to the busy and \n    fast-paced lifestyles here. Traditionally, it has been used to boost physical performance and revitalize the body. \n    Its effects are felt quickly and can last for several hours after consumption but is primarily intended for short-term use.</p>"
              },
              "definition" : "community_builder:htmlEditor",
              "id" : "48494fad-b8a2-4b78-9ff9-cfb871680a75",
              "type" : "component"
            } ],
