                "richTextValue" : "<h1>Sea Cucumbers</h2>\n\n<p>Sea cucumbers, a marine animal closely related to sea stars and sea urchins, \n    have elongated bodies with tentacles for feeding. They are shaped like a \n    cucumber with leathery skin and a distinct phallic-like appearance. \n    Sea cucumbers are present throughout the world, often found in warm, shallow \n    ocean waters; however, some are found at significant ocean depths. </p>"
              },
              "definition" : "community_builder:htmlEditor",
              "id" : "9d0988a3-d8a1-4f20-95ad-02560354fd87",
              "type" : "component"
            } ],
