              "attributes" : {
                "dxpStyle" : { },
                "imageInfos" : "",
                "richTextValue" : "<h1>Abalone</h1>\n\n<p>Abalone is a marine mollusk known for its rich, flavorful meat. In the past, \n    it was only consumed by royalty and elites, particularly in East Asia, due to \n    the expense. In parallel, abalone was also consumed by Native Americans along the coast of California. \n    To this day, abalone is considered a delicacy in Asian culture and can \n    still be found along the coastal areas of California. </p>"
              },
